Package: plasma-integration
Version: @DEB_PLASMAINTEGRATION_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: KDE
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://kde.org/
Depends: qt6-base, qt6-declarative, qt6-wayland, libwayland0, kf6-colorscheme, kf6-config, kf6-guiaddons, kf6-i18n, kf6-iconthemes, kf6-kio, kf6-notifications, kf6-statusnotifieritem, kf6-windowsystem, kf6-xmlgui, plasma-wayland-protocols
Description: Plasma Qt platform theme for Xios
 Plasma Integration provides the KDE Qt platform theme plugin, so Qt and KDE
 applications inherit Plasma fonts, icons, colors, dialogs, and Wayland appmenu
 integration instead of falling back to generic Qt defaults.
